      "text": "A page from a CVSource (投中信息) Chinese-language investment-research report with the same heading \"港交所主板账面退出回报最高\", for May 2025. A red rectangle covers the opening paragraph and the exit-analysis table; the bar-and-line chart beneath runs 2024-05 to 2025-05. It is the immediate sibling of the April page and differs in its figures rather than its layout.",
